# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone FWS_OUTSIDE / interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0
#   zone FWS_INSIDE / interface GigabitEthernet0/0/1
#   zone DMZ / interface GigabitEthernet0/0/2
#   zone FWS_LAB / interface GigabitEthernet0/0/3
#   zone FWS_MGMT / interface GigabitEthernet0
# Written inactive:
#   WAN-IN-130 (OUTSIDE to OUTSIDE): not converted: time-range OFFICE: active only part of the time
#   WAN-IN-130 (OUTSIDE to INSIDE): not converted: time-range OFFICE: active only part of the time
#   WAN-IN-140 + no outbound access list + no zone pair from OUTSIDE to INSIDE (OUTSIDE to INSIDE)-2: every service but some: a service object of ZLD lists what it matches
#   WAN-IN-130 (OUTSIDE to DMZ): not converted: time-range OFFICE: active only part of the time
#   WAN-IN-140 + DMZ-OUT-50 (OUTSIDE to DMZ)-2: every service but some: a service object of ZLD lists what it matches
#   WAN-IN-130 (OUTSIDE to LAB): not converted: time-range OFFICE: active only part of the time
#   WAN-IN-130 (OUTSIDE to MGMT): not converted: time-range OFFICE: active only part of the time
#   110-40 (LAB to OUTSIDE): not converted: 'fragments' is not converted
#   110-40 (LAB to INSIDE): not converted: 'fragments' is not converted
#   110-40 (LAB to DMZ): not converted: 'fragments' is not converted
#   110-40 (LAB to LAB): not converted: 'fragments' is not converted
#   110-40 (LAB to MGMT): not converted: 'fragments' is not converted
